  "root_cause": "OBS recipe_create_changelog reads .changes to provide BUILD_CHANGELOG_TIMESTAMP before RPM starts. Existing spec-only uploads left this unset. Leap profile then emitted a missing-epoch warning and a secondary misleading BUILD_RELEASE warning. RPM later derived the correct spec changelog epoch, but that occurred after shell initialization.",
  "fix": "Both preparation tools derive the standard .changes sidecar from the complete spec changelog with explicit midnight UTC dates and pin its hash. Spec, source archives, existing release notes and compiler flags are unchanged.",
  "unit_tests": 173,
  "converter_roundtrips": 57,
  "inventory_scope": "All 37 committed catalog recipes available at their pins and 20 dependency working-tree recipes. The NATS module catalog pin predates its pending spec and is excluded.",
